   "summary": "Gillard sends a 1943 list of Japanese organizations from the Nippon Times Weekly, valuable since such material was scarce.",
   "title": "Despatch No. 14055 from U.S. Embassy Buenos Aires transmitting list of Japanese organizations",
   "to": "Secretary of State, Washington"
  },
  {
   "about": "Comprehensive directory of Japanese newspapers, chambers of commerce, and semi-official organizations handling activities across the Greater East Asia Co-Prosperity Sphere.",
